    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]REGIMENTAL COMMAND - CHINOOK 91 GSO STATION[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Operational Objectives - Trijent Dam AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-AQ"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"You are ordered to deploy to Trijent Dam, a hydroelectric power installation supplying Oxley's Butte and its lithium export lanes."}

    {"The colony lost contact following seismic irregularities and a sharp drop in power output."}

    {"Expect hostile resistance and terrain instability."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish and secure a Forward Operating Base that enables you easy access to the turbine control complex."}
    {"[bullet]Recover surviving maintenance personnel and security teams stationed along the dam interior and technical storage."}
    {"[bullet]Retrieve engineering logs and lithium transport manifests from the operations terminal and export pad."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Restore power flow to the lower generator rooms to reactivate water purification systems."}
    {"[bullet]Prevent damage to lithium isotope storage. Potential for secondary contamination."}
    {"[bullet]Neutralize any hostiles occupying the dam itself or central access bridge."}

    {"Expect high humidity, low visibility, and possible water contamination."}
    {"Proceed with caution."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Second Lieutenant Lucas Harlan[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]Strategic Liaison Officer | 2nd Battalion, 3rd Regiment - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]For the Corps.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
