    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]TECHNICAL OPERATIONS DIRECTORATE - ANVIL STATION, HERCULINA ORBIT[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Research-Oriented Objectives - Trijent Dam AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-RI"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Trijent Dam contains high-priority experimental tech: isotope compressors, real-time lithium sensors, and Weston-Yamada efficiency algorithms."}

    {"We suspect biological exposure to Tritium waste may have catalyzed variant behavior."}

    {"Document it."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Deploy your FOB at a location that maximizes access to any lithium or tritium storage facilities."}
    {"[bullet]Recover mining telemetry, Tritium extraction records, and mutated organism bio-signs."}
    {"[bullet]Secure vent camera logs and pump reactor feedback loops for behavioral study."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Preserve cryostorage and pipeflow AI modules located near the western dam maintenance controls."}
    {"[bullet]Tag and track any infestations around the coolant reservoir or outflow chute."}
    {"[bullet]Extract or study hostile organisms found near contaminated water treatment zones."}

    {"Study any affected organisms. Don't just kill them."}
    {"Knowledge is the payload here."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Lt. Colonel Geoffrey Lamdem[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]Division Logistics Commander | Military Organization for Development and Innovation - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]Onward through progress.[/italic][/color]"}

